  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from 3rd May 2019 being the date of granting of planning permission 01159/1/S1.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (248004/D/PL100, received on 28/01/2019; Design and Access Statement, prepared by Pellings [dated March 2019], received on 15/03/2019; 19/008/C/001 Rev H, 19/008/C/002 Rev H, 19/008/C/003 Rev B & Cover Letter (ref: 19/008/C/mc) [dated 19 November 2020], received on 27/11/2020) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The development shall not be implemented other than in accordance with the materials approved under 01159/1/S1(3-11).",
    "Condition : 4 - No additional windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the walls of the hereby approved development and no additional doors inserted in the building without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - The windows formed in the east elevation shall be obscure glazed and non-opening and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing for the duration of the development.",
    "Condition : 6 - The development shall not be carried out other than in accordance with the hard and soft landscaping works approved under 01159/1/S1(3-11).",
    "Condition : 7 - A splay of 2.4m x 2.4m shall be provided on each side of the access, the depth measured from the back of the footway and the widths outwards from the edges of the access, and no fence, wall or other obstruction to visibility exceeding 0.6m in height above the surface of the adjoining highway shall be erected within the areas of such splays.",
    "Condition : 8 - The development shall not be carried out other than in accordance with the cycle parking details approved under 01159/1/S1(3-11).",
    "Condition : 9 - The development shall not be carried out other than in accordance with the storage of waste and recycling bins approved under 01159/1/S1(3-11).",
    "Condition : 10 - The hereby approved development shall incorporate measures for the insulation of the proposed dwelling against the transmission of externally generated road, rail and aircraft noise (and vibration), taking account of any ventilation requirements necessary, in order to ensure that the maximum noise levels permitted within the dwelling rooms do not exceed those that are specified in Table 4 of BS8233 (2014) [Living Rooms= 35 dB; LAeq, 16 hours; Dining room/area = 40 dB LAeq, 16 hours; Bedroom = 35 dB LAeq, 16 hours during day-time (07:00 - 23:00) and Bedroom = 30 dB LAeq, 8 hours during night-time (23:00 - 07:00)].",
    "Condition : 11 - The development shall not be carried out other than in accordance with the energy statement, internal water consumption and sustainable materials standards approved under 01159/1/S1(3-11).",
    "Condition : 12 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) 1995 (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) no enlargement of the premises or any additional structures/buildings within the curtilage of the site shall be carried out.",
    "Condition : 13 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9:00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority."
  ],
